<title>CHILE: Chile markets closed Friday for All Saints Day.</title>
<headline>Chile markets closed Friday for All Saints Day.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's financial and stock markets are closed Friday in observance of All Saints Day.</p>
<p>The markets will re-open Monday.</p>
<p>--Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
